#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Početak"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter of the &kdeprint; Handbook will walk you through most of the "
"configuration or selection options of &kdeprint;. It will mainly deal with "
"&CUPS; in this version, as the author is most familiar with it, and also "
"because &kdeprint; started off with supporting &CUPS; best. Later versions "
"of the &kdeprint; software and editions of this handbook will support and "
"explore other printing systems more closely."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje &kdeprint; Priručnika će vas provesti kroz većinu "
"konfiguracije ili odabira opcija &kdeprint;-a; U ovoj verziji će se većinom "
"baviti &CUPS;-om, obzirom da to autoru najpoznatije, i zato što je "
"&kdeprint; započeo svoj rad podržavajući &CUPS;. Kasnije verzije &kdeprint;-"
"ovih softvera i izdanja Priručnika će podržavati i temeljitije istraživati "
"ostale štampačke sisteme."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Your Print Subsystem"
msgstr "Odabir Vašeg Štampačkog Podsistema"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need to define your print subsystem, before you are able to install any "
"printer with the &kdeprint; framework. There are two areas where you can "
"define this: either in &kcontrol; (The <guilabel>Printing Manager</guilabel> "
"section), or directly and <quote>on the fly</quote> from the print dialog."
msgstr ""
"Potrebno je da definišete Vaš print podsistem, prije nego što instalirate "
"bilo koji štampač sa &kdeprint; framework-om. To možete uraditi na "
"dvanalina: U &kcontrol; (Sekcija <guilabel>Menadžer štampanja</guilabel>), "
"ili direktno i <quote>usput</quote> u dijalogu  za štampanje."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Navigate to <menuchoice><guimenu>K Menu</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Preferences</"
"guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>System</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Printing Manager</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. At the bottom you can see a button that lets you "
"select which printing subsystem you want to use. In &kde; 2.2 you can choose "
"from the following alternatives:"
msgstr ""
"Idite na <menuchoice><guimenu>K Meni</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Preference</"
"guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>Sistem</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Menadžer štampanja</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Na dnu ćete vidjeti dugme koje Vam omogućuje da "
"birate koji štampački podsistem želite koristiti. u &kde; 2.2 možete "
"izabrati između sljedećih alternativa:"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "&CUPS; (Common &UNIX; Printing System)"
msgstr "&CUPS; (Poznati &UNIX; Štampački sistem)"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Print through an external program (generic)"
msgstr "Printanje putem eksternog programa (generičko)"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>LPR</acronym> (Standard <acronym>BSD</acronym> Print System)"
msgstr ""
"<acronym>LPR</acronym> (Standardni <acronym>BSD</acronym> Štampački Sistem)"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generic &UNIX; <acronym>LPD</acronym> print system (the default)"
msgstr ""
"Generički &UNIX; <acronym>LPD</acronym> štampački sistem (podrazumijevani)"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>RLPR</acronym> environment (print to remote <acronym>LPD</acronym> "
"servers from the command line)"
msgstr ""
"<acronym>RLPR</acronym> okruženje (štampaj na udaljenim <acronym>LPD</"
"acronym> serverima sa komandne linije)"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Of course, the chosen system must be installed, and up and running on your "
"box prior to your selection, or before it takes effect."
msgstr ""
"Naravno, odabrani sistem mora biti instaliran, i pokrenut prije vašeg "
"odabira, odnosno prije nego što stupi na snagu."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On its first startup, &kdeprint; will try an autodetection. This only works "
"for:"
msgstr ""
"Na njegovom prvom pokretanju, &kdeprint; će pokušati autodetekciju: Ovo radi "
"samo za:"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "&CUPS;, as it is checking first for a running &CUPS; daemon"
msgstr "&CUPS;, kao da prvi put provjerava da li je pokrenut &CUPS; daemon"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>LPD</acronym>, as it is checking for a running <acronym>LPD</"
"acronym> daemon, plus a <filename>printcap</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>LPD</acronym>, kao da provjerava da li je pokrenut  <acronym>LPD</"
"acronym> daemon, i datoteka <filename>printcap</filename> ."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The system you choose must be installed on your system prior to your "
"selection. The author's personal recommendation is &CUPS;."
msgstr ""
"Sistem koji ste odabrali mora biti instaliran na Vašem sistemu prije Vaše "
"selekcije. Autorova preporuka je &CUPS;."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once autodetected, chosen, or changed, the active print subsystem will take "
"effect for all &kde; applications. Different users may have different print "
"subsystems in use, if those do exist on the computer and are compliant with "
"each other. Their settings are stored in the <filename>kdeprintrc</"
"filename>. This file is unique to every user, and is normally installed in "
"<filename>$<envar>HOME</envar>/.kde/share/config/kdeprintrc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Jednom kada je autodetektovan, odabran ili promijenjen, aktivni štampački "
"podsistem će uticati na sve &kde; aplikacije, Različiti korisnici mogu imati "
"različite štampačke podsisteme u upotrebi, ako oni postoje i ako su "
"usklađeni. Njihove opcije su spašene u  <filename>kdeprintrc</filename>. Ova "
"datoteka je jedinstvena za svakog korisnika, i obično je instalirana na "
"<filename>$<envar>HOME</envar>/.kde/share/config/kdeprintrc</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This file is not intended to be directly editable, and all available options "
"can be set from the &kdeprint; &GUI;."
msgstr ""
"Ova datoteka ne može biti direktno uređivana, sve moguće opcije mogu biti "
"postavljene sa &kdeprint; &GUI;."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may even select a different printer subsystem, on the fly, from the "
"&kprinter; dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Možete također odabrati drugi štampački podsistem sa &kprinter; dijaloškog "
"okvira."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with the Printing Manager"
msgstr "Rad sa Menadžerom Štampanja"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have chosen your preferred and installed print subsystem, you are "
"ready to investigate, configure administer and work with this system through "
"the &kdeprint; framework."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste završili sa odabirom Vašeg štampačkog podsistema, spremni ste za "
"istraživanje, konfigurišite administraciju i radite sa ovim sistemom preko "
"&kdeprint; framework-a."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Navigate to <menuchoice><guimenu>K Menu</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Preferences</"
"guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>System</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Printing Manager</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. In the right part of the window you will see at "
"least 4 printers predefined. These are the virtual or special purpose "
"printers, explained in section . You will probably see a toolbar with 13 "
"icons at the top of the window, and at least 4 tabs in the lower half of the "
"window, labeled <guilabel>Information</guilabel>, <guilabel>Jobs</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Properties</guilabel> and <guilabel>Instances</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Idite na <menuchoice><guimenu>K Menu</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Preference</"
"guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>Sistem</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Menadžer Štampanja</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Na desnom dijelu prozora vidjet ćete najmanje 4 "
"unaprijed definirana štampača. Ovo su virtualni štampači ili štampači "
"specijalnih namjena, objašnjeni u sekcijama. Vjerovatno ćete vidjeti alatnu "
"traku sa 13 ikona na vrhu prozora, i najmanje 4 taba na donjoj polovini "
"prozora, označena kao <guilabel>Informacije</guilabel>, <guilabel>Poslovi</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Svojstva</guilabel> i <guilabel>Instance</guilabel>."
